# Content & brand governance

- Treat `core/brand/brand_rules.json` and Messaging Foundation references as source of truth.
- QA must keep `approval_required=True` until a human approves.
- Do not weaken forbidden-jargon or mandatory-terminology checks to greenwash tests.
- Optimization loops may rewrite content; they must not skip QA or approval.
- Prefer reusable brand validation (`core/brand/rules.py`, `core/qa/brand.py`) over duplicated prompt text.
- Export formats: JSON, DOCX, XLSX only after `HumanApprovalGate` approval.
